Coverage limits
---------------
The standard run enumerated three bus-0 functions. The code scans the configured 16-bus ECAM span and honors multifunction header bits, but nonzero-bus/multifunction topology was not exercised in this run. I/O BARs are recognized but not allocated; bridge recursion/window programming is deferred to Phase 108. ECAM is still guest-writable for the assigned function.
